 60CU c  Phys Rev C 69, 037303 (2004)                                           
 60CU c  Compiled by J. Roediger and B. Singh (McMaster), May 4, 2004           
 60CU c  E=96 MeV.  Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g, |g|g(|q)(DCO), |g|g(lin pol)       
 60CU2c  with the EUROBALL Ge-detector array consisting of 26 CLOVER detectors  
 60CU3c  and 15 CLUSTER detectors. Evaporated charged particles were detected   
 60CU4c  in the 40-element silicon |dE-E array ISIS.                            
 60CU cG $POL=[aN(perpendicular)-N(parallel)]/[aN(perpendicular)+N(parallel)],  
 60CU2cG where a=normalization function. POL is positive for stretched pure     
 60CU3cG electric transitions and negative for stretched pure magnetic          
 60CU4cG transitions                                                            
